          "type": "table",
          "title": "Entitlement — Who Holds Each GPU",
          "description": "The raw grant: which pod has been given which device or MIG instance, and how (device-plugin, annotation, or DRA). This is entitlement, not activity — a row here with nothing in the Per-Pod usage panels is a GPU that is held and idle, which is exactly what automated reclamation looks for. The underlying series is a constant 1; everything meaningful is in its labels, which is why this is a table and not a graph.",
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 8,
            "w": 24,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "gpu-prometheus"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "expr": "gpu_alloc_device_pod_info{gpu_uuid=~\"$gpu\"}",
              "format": "table",
              "instant": true
            }
          ],
          "transformations": [
            {
              "id": "organize",
              "options": {
                "excludeByName": {
                  "Time": true,
                  "__name__": true,
                  "job": true,
                  "instance": true,
                  "service": true,
                  "endpoint": true,
                  "node": true,
                  "gpu": true,
                  "Value": true
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {},
            "overrides": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "type": "table",
          "title": "Metric Support Matrix",
          "description": "Whether each GPU can produce each metric this dashboard uses: 'Supported', 'Not supported on this GPU' (a hardware or driver limitation, not a fault), or absent from this table entirely, which means UNKNOWN — the exporter could not determine support and nothing is claimed either way. Check here before concluding an empty panel elsewhere on this dashboard is broken.",
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 14,
            "w": 24,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 8
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
